            "notes": "## POWER\n- [Reload Therapy](item_1d85105f-1ec7-4ec7-a56d-f273c09f4b3e): This power is the best power if you want a extremely good survivability especially against your counters:\n1) It allows your supports to be less dependant of you.\n2) You can play more proactively because you can heal yourself whenever you want.\n3) I feel like the annoying long reload part of Ashe is a bit more fun because of this power.\n\n## CORE ITEMS\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \n\n## IMPORTANT TIP:\n- Don't play with full ammo. It's recommended to play most of the time around 9 ammos so if you need heal, you can reload to trigger [Reload Therapy](item_1d85105f-1ec7-4ec7-a56d-f273c09f4b3e).",
